    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44071" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθῡν-τήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>corrector, chastiser</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕβριος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one who levels</i> or <i>straightens</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θριγκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					4.293
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> as
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθυντὴρ οἴαξ</span>
			the <i>guiding</i> rudder, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				717
			</span></i>.</div>
